es.js", "toolkit/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/browser/browser.ini", "toolkit/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/browser/browser_policies_gpo.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1a1391dec97a434460b9040f7256ac3348c69d68", "parents": ["dbfd477ed09853fa997da42f9cb6cc325f177956"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Kaply \u003cmozilla@kaply.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1552600 - Allow policies.json to augment platform policy. r=emalysz, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D103077", "files": ["toolkit/components/enterprisepolicies/EnterprisePolicies.js", "toolkit/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/browser/browser_policies_gpo.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "35632a8bfc99a72bcfd62f165ac95c9f029715c1", "parents": ["1a1391dec97a434460b9040f7256ac3348c69d68"], "tags": []}], "date": 1615325962, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "219": {"changesets": [{"author": "sanketh \u003cme@snkth.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1655482 - Bump MinGW to fix the STATUS_HEAP_CORRUPTION define. r=tjr, a=RyanVM\n\n- Bump MinGW version\n- Add patch to workaround MinGW's dwrite_3.h\n- Remove MinGW workaround for STATUS_HEAP_CORRUPTION define\n- Remove MinGW workaround in MMPolicies.h.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D91157", "files": ["mozglue/misc/interceptor/MMPolicies.h", "taskcluster/ci/fetch/toolchains.yml", "taskcluster/scripts/misc/build-clang-mingw.sh", "taskcluster/scripts/misc/mingw-dwrite_3.patch"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1b0e1f0d885ef849e75b409d4795271f635ebe0c", "parents": ["35632a8bfc99a72bcfd62f165ac95c9f029715c1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "David Major \u003cdmajor@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1681123 - Bump mingw-w64 revision to fix _aligned_malloc in clang 12. r=tjr, a=RyanVM\n\nclang 12 (specifically https://reviews.llvm.org/D91379) made some refactorings to libc++ that exposed a problem in the MinGW headers. That has now been fixed upstream.\n\nIn the meantime the headers also gained definitions for ProcessPayloadRestrictionPolicy, so we can remove our workaround for that.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D98945", "files": ["mozglue/misc/WindowsProcessMitigations.cpp", "taskcluster/ci/fetch/toolchains.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d726d74daa39c8413750f29f75a49a06f3b55b07", "parents": ["1b0e1f0d885ef849e75b409d4795271f635ebe0c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Karl Tomlinson \u003ckarlt+@karlt.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1695161 - update m_writeIndex even when it would not wrap to buffer start. r=Gankra, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D107595", "files": ["dom/media/webaudio/blink/ReverbInputBuffer.cpp", "testing/web-platform/meta/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-convolvernode-interface/realtime-conv.html.ini"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "53999ac8db916fe4234ea0ace08f15ce9d729b81", "parents": ["d726d74daa39c8413750f29f75a49a06f3b55b07"], "tags": []}, {"author": "James Teh \u003cjteh@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1688532: Don't use the cached column header on a previous table cell if that cell starts in a different column. r=eeejay, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D103146", "files": ["accessible/generic/TableCellAccessible.cpp", "accessible/tests/mochitest/table/test_headers_table.html"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "7e82ead34b596ca9a2e84f315193b6f44cf482db", "parents": ["53999ac8db916fe4234ea0ace08f15ce9d729b81"], "tags": []}], "date": 1615428798, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "220": {"changesets": [{"author": "sanketh \u003cme@snkth.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1668304 - Bump mingw-clang builds to clang 11. r=tjr,dmajor a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D94676", "files": ["build/build-clang/clang-11-mingw.json", "build/build-clang/clang-9-mingw.json", "taskcluster/ci/fetch/toolchains.yml", "taskcluster/ci/toolchain/clang.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "cc840a0083938b925242afd6d9706ff90a609790", "parents": ["7e82ead34b596ca9a2e84f315193b6f44cf482db"], "tags": []}, {"author": "David Major \u003cdmajor@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1658632 - Don't strip d3dcompiler_47.dll. r=glandium, a=RyanVM\n\nThe llvm-strip from clang-11 complains about this file. This file doesn't really interest us anyway -- it's imported from elsewhere -- so just avoid it.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D89491", "files": ["python/mozbuild/mozpack/executables.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "cf1ff3a632bfca89f5ccd10ce8dc7a3a304ebbd0", "parents": ["cc840a0083938b925242afd6d9706ff90a609790"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1692972 - Add DoubleValue masking for LBox/LBoxFloatingPoint. r=iain, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D107042", "files": ["js/src/jit/x64/CodeGenerator-x64.cpp", "js/src/jit/x86/CodeGenerator-x86.cpp", "js/src/jit/x86/LIR-x86.h", "js/src/jit/x86/Lowering-x86.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e11e53daf76d5e1dd3fcc56797c6cd727562aba5", "parents": ["cf1ff3a632bfca89f5ccd10ce8dc7a3a304ebbd0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris Peterson \u003ccpeterson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1679929 - Cap the User-Agent string's reported macOS version at 10.15 like Safari does. r=valentin,hsivonen a=RyanVM\n\nAnd always report \"Intel\" Mac OS X.\n\nFixes webcompat bugs like bug 1680516. Some UA-sniffing sites assume the User-Agent string's macOS version always begin with \"10.\" and they break if the User-Agent string reports version 11.0 on macOS Big Sur (11.0 aka 10.16).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D106729", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpHandler.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1765c2fe7a41df0da7e312c10868476074faebcf", "parents": ["e11e53daf76d5e1dd3fcc56797c6cd727562aba5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris Peterson \u003ccpeterson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1679929 - Add tests for the default User-Agent string. r=valentin, a=RyanVM\n\nWe previously had no tests for the default User-Agent string values, just for the spoofed values when resistFingerprinting is enabled!\n\nDepends on D106729\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D106730", "files": ["browser/components/resistfingerprinting/test/browser/browser_navigator.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b0af2983066300e793455a4ca8f8e458629e4617", "parents": ["1765c2fe7a41df0da7e312c10868476074faebcf"], "tags": []}], "date": 1615482823, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "221": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003cryanvm@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Backed out changeset e11e53daf76d (bug 1692972) for bustage.", "files": ["js/src/jit/x64/CodeGenerator-x64.cpp", "js/src/jit/x86/CodeGenerator-x86.cpp", "js/src/jit/x86/LIR-x86.h", "js/src/jit/x86/Lowering-x86.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "92e6877143422e4f768fb202cd26f216e1500c1a", "parents": ["b0af2983066300e793455a4ca8f8e458629e4617"], "tags": []}], "date": 1615493469, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "222": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1692972 - Add DoubleValue masking for LBox/LBoxFloatingPoint. r=iain, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D107042", "files": ["js/src/jit/MacroA